  | DmDemote UInt64.t
  | DmRemove UInt64.t
  | DmCreate UInt64.t
  | DmPromote UInt64.t
  | RelRead UInt64.t int
  | RelWrite UInt64.t int
  | Enq t_Job
  | ExtFree UInt64.t UInt64.t
  | Recover UInt64.t UInt64.t UInt32.t
  | EmFormat UInt64.t
  | EmInit UInt64.t
  | Checkpoint UInt64.t
  | DevSignal UInt64.t
  | DevShutdown UInt64.t
  | DevDetach UInt64.t
  | Register
  | Unregister
  | Join
  | Leave
  | SsdRead UInt64.t UInt64.t
  | SsdWrite UInt64.t UInt64.t
